OL,3,GNEWSAEnhanced security ahead of Labour
OL,4,AParty conference
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 20,000 delegates and visitors are
OL,7,Fexpected in Liverpool for the opening
OL,8,Fof the Labour Party conference at the
OL,9,Fweekend.
OL,11,FIt will be held at the Liverpool
OL,12,FExperience Campus from Saturday until
OL,13,FWednesday, and there will be a higher
OL,14,Fpolice and security presence around the
OL,15,Farea throughout.
OL,17,FThe party's fifth successive conference
OL,18,Fin the city, it will mark Andy
OL,19,FBurnham's first as Prime Minister.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
