OL,3,GNEWSAEnhanced security ahead of Labour
OL,4,AParty conference
OL,5,
OL,6,FSuperintendent Pete Clark, from
OL,7,FMerseyside Police's force operations
OL,8,Fteam, said: "In 2024, we had Labour for
OL,9,Fthe first year as the party in power.
OL,10,FIt definitely does change the dynamic
OL,11,Fof the operation."
